package CanvasNet {
    part def MermaidScenePainter {
        doc /* The internal ScenePainter of the Mermaid package (a sealed partial class in ScenePainter.cs, ScenePainter.Text.cs, and ScenePainter.Images.cs), the ScenePlacement record struct (Uniform enlarges the view box by a scale at the origin; Fit scales it uniformly by the largest factor that fits a target and centers it, leaving a view box without area unscaled), and the ISceneImageLoader contract. Paint creates a surface, fills it with the background (transparent when none), and draws the items in list order translated by their groups: paths are converted with Scene.ToPath and filled with the core PathFiller under their fill rule, then stroked in device space with PathStroker (scaled width, cap, join, miter limit 4, scaled dashes; a pattern with a negative or non-finite entry, a period under a quarter pixel, or more than 50,000 estimated dashes is drawn solid); text runs are drawn one after the other at the scaled size with the face that the call's FontResolver resolves (CreateFontResolver maps common aliases such as Mermaid's default stack to the bundled Liberation families and never uses installed fonts), anchored at the start, middle, or end; pictures are requested from the scene's loader at the device size of their box snapped outward to whole pixels, stretched to the box when they come back at another size (preserveAspectRatio none), and composited with the item's opacity, and nothing is drawn without a loader. Every item with a non-finite coordinate or one beyond 32,768 device pixels is skipped; the device box of every fill, stroke, text line, and picture, clipped to the surface, is charged to MaxPaintedPixels before it is painted and the item that would pass the limit throws a located MermaidRenderException mermaid-limit-exceeded naming the limit; the cancellation token is checked before every item; the created surface is disposed on failure. Deterministic; one painting per instance on one thread. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Scenegraph/ScenePainter.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Scenegraph/ScenePainter.Text.cs, src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid/Scenegraph/ScenePainter.Images.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.Mermaid.Tests/Scenegraph/ScenePainterTests.cs */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-mermaid/scenegraph/scene-painter.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-mermaid/scenegraph/scene-painter.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-mermaid/scenegraph/scene-painter.yaml */
    }
}
